#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:5
msgid "Folio referencing settings"
msgstr "Folio 引用设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech provides the option to storage at the Data from the application"
" some `project properties`_ pre-defined by the user. This feature allows the"
" user avoiding to define many `project properties`_ each time that the user "
"`creates new projects`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 从应用程序中提供了从数据中存储一些 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ "
"由用户预先定义的选项。该特性允许用户每次在用户 `创建新项目 <project properties_>`_ 时避免定义许多 `项目属性 "
"<creates new projects_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:11
msgid ""
"The **Folio referencing** tab from **New project** settings section allows "
"pre-defining the formula which should define the label variable from "
"`Reference folio following`_ and `Previous reference folio`_."
msgstr ""
"那个 **Folio 参考** 选项卡 **新项目** 设置部分允许预先定义公式，该公式应当定义标签变量。 `以下参考框 <Reference "
"folio following_>`_ 和 `上一个参考文件 <Previous reference folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:17
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech New project folio referencing settings"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 新建项目 folio 引用设置"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:19
msgid "To define folio referencing settings:"
msgstr "定义folio 引用设置："

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:21
msgid "`Display`_ QElectroTech settings PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ QElectroTech设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:22
msgid "Go to **New project** section."
msgstr "转到 **新项目** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:23
msgid "Go to **Folio referencing** tab."
msgstr "转到 **Folio 引用** 标签 。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:24
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "定义每个字段的理想参数。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:25
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close settings "
"PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改和关闭设置 PopUP 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/preferences/new_project/folio_referencings_settings.rst:29
msgid ""
"All pre-defined folio referencing properties defined at QElectroTech "
"settings PopUP window will be automatically defined during `project "
"creation`_ at `project properties`_. The folio referencing properties can be"
" found at `Folio referencing tab`_ from `New folio`_ section."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 设置中定义的所有预定义的 folio 引用属性将在 PopuUP 窗口中自动定义 `项目创建 <project "
"creation_>`_ 时间 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_。在 `Folio 引用标签 <Folio "
"referencing tab_>`_ 从 `新组合 <New folio_>`_ 节。"
